## Fenrir package repo ([fenrir] in pacman.conf) - caelestia-shell/-cli
## post-install updates. Included into [fenrir]'s section by
## fenrir-installer/lib/backend.py's configure_fenrir_repo(), same
## Include-a-mirrorlist shape [cachyos] already uses with its own
## cachyos-mirrorlist.
##
## pacman tries Server= lines in listed order and only falls to the next
## one on failure, not by speed - so the dedicated VPS mirror (once it
## exists) belongs first, already in its intended final position, with
## GitHub Pages underneath as the always-on free fallback. Adding the VPS
## later is just uncommenting the line below and filling in the real URL;
## no reordering, and nothing elsewhere needs to change.

#Server = https://<future-vps-mirror>/$arch
Server = https://lawki2.github.io/Fenrir/$arch
